{"id":"vod_md_5043","vodId":"5043","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"男子游泳部第二季","name_cn":"男子游泳部第二季","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230916-1/1c5352d331a79ee932efd2bf54b20ece.jpg"},"summary":"炎热的夏天又到了，观众们则迎来了活力四射、清凉十足的运动番《Free!》第二季！五位游泳部的伙伴，再次带着分外瞩目的肌肉线条，展开了关于游泳和友情的青春故事。在第二季中，主人公七濑遥（岛崎信长 配音）以及好朋友橘真琴（铃木达央 配音）成为岩鸢高中三年级生，他们一方面烦恼着没有新人加入游泳部，另一方面还面临着毕业去向问题。同为游泳部成员的渚（代永翼 配音）和怜（平川大辅 配音），积极准备着全国大赛的训练。与第一季相比，本季最大的看点，就是新角色山崎宗介（细谷佳正 配音）的登场。他是凛（宫野真守 配音）小学时代的好友，游泳实力强劲，转校归来加入了凛的游泳部。两个游泳部，两支接力队伍，在未来的全国赛上，会碰撞出什么样的青春水花？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-16 08:42:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/x9beiMRY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/iRhUq64X/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/2DcoyLNH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/Q62NPIeP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/0pa5VF88/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/RdwKChUx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/SeqYMTro/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/8uyOfhiN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/wPNXEjSJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/5dE4vnP0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/Vk8rPOYk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/mO5qbBKp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/Qu964oZy/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:43:07.861Z"}